# TennisConnect

TennisConnect is a production-quality tennis community platform for Australia.

The project connects:

- Players
- Coaches
- Clubs
- Communities
- Tournaments
- Travel
- Marketplace
- Articles

The project follows a clean, scalable architecture.

---

# Project Goals

The codebase should be:

- Clean
- Reusable
- Responsive
- Easy to maintain
- Easy to understand
- Production ready

Always preserve the existing architecture.

