# API

Use REST endpoints.

Keep API responses consistent.

Typical response

```json
{
  "success": true
}
```

List endpoints should return

```json
{
    "players": [],
    "pagination": {}
}
```

Do not change API shape without request.

---

# Pagination

List pages use backend pagination.

Current standard:

page

limit

pagination object

Example

```json
{
    "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 24,
        "total": 120,
        "totalPages": 5
    }
}
```

Frontend should never paginate locally.

---

# Shared Components

Prefer existing shared components.

Examples

AppPagination

LoadingSpinner

SectionHeader

PlayerCard

CoachCard

Hero

Never duplicate shared UI.

---

# Routing

Wouter is used.

Prefer

```tsx
<Link href="/players">
```

Avoid introducing React Router.

---

# Styling

Use Tailwind CSS.

Follow existing TennisConnect spacing.

Rounded corners:

rounded-xl

rounded-2xl

rounded-3xl

Cards should have

shadow

border

hover transition

Avoid inconsistent styling.

---

# Responsive Design

Every page must support

Desktop

Tablet

Mobile

Mobile-first.

Never implement desktop only.

---

# Cards

Player cards

Coach cards

Tournament cards

Travel cards

should all share the same visual language.

Consistent

spacing

buttons

radius

hover

padding

---

# Images

Prefer Supabase Storage.

Fallback images are acceptable.

Always include

alt

loading="lazy"

when appropriate.

---

# Forms

Use controlled inputs.

Validation before submit.

Show friendly error messages.

Do not reset form unexpectedly.

---

# Profile Pages

Player

Coach

have similar architecture.

Prefer reusing logic.

Avoid duplicated code.

---

# Authentication

Authentication is cookie based.

Always include

credentials: "include"

when required.

Do not break authentication flow.

---

# Uploads

Avatar

Cover

Gallery

use upload endpoints.

Do not change upload flow.

Preserve existing response format.

---

# Performance

Reuse API responses.

Avoid unnecessary requests.

Avoid unnecessary re-renders.

Prefer reusable components.

---

# Accessibility

Buttons should have labels.

Images should have alt.

Keyboard navigation should work.

Interactive elements must remain accessible.

---

# Code Evolution

When extending TennisConnect:

Prefer extending existing modules.

Do not rewrite existing architecture.

Do not introduce unnecessary abstractions.

Keep git diffs small.

